		'E2E pattern for real ./run processes: write a local.ts into the temp HAL_HOME that sets `terminal.available = () => true`, replaces `terminal.realIO` with a pipe-backed TerminalIO (stdin in, stdout out, fixed size) and points `anthropic.apiUrl` at a fake server. Nothing in src needs a test hook for this; reuse it (src/e2e.test.ts).',
		'Fake SSE servers that hold a stream open need `Bun.serve({ idleTimeout: 0 })`, or Bun drops the connection after its default idle timeout and the test sees a stream error instead.',
